{"id":"torrey:happiness-of-the-wicked-the","source":"torrey","name":"Happiness Of The Wicked, The","slug":"happiness-of-the-wicked-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is limited to this life — Ps 17:14; Lu 16:25.","refs":[["Ps",17,14,17,14],["Luke",16,25,16,25]]},{"text":"Is short — Job 20:5.","refs":[["Job",20,5,20,5]]},{"text":"Is uncertain — Lu 12:20; Jas 4:13,14.","refs":[["Luke",12,20,12,20],["Jas",4,13,4,13],["Jas",4,14,4,14]]},{"text":"Is vain — Ec 2:1; 7:6.","refs":[["Eccl",2,1,2,1],["Eccl",7,6,7,6]]},{"text":"Their wealth. — Job 21:13; Ps 52:7.","refs":[["Job",21,13,21,13],["Ps",52,7,52,7]]},{"text":"Their power. — Job 21:7; Ps 37:35.","refs":[["Job",21,7,21,7],["Ps",37,35,37,35]]},{"text":"Their worldly prosperity. — Ps 17:14; 73:3,4,7.","refs":[["Ps",17,14,17,14],["Ps",73,3,73,3],["Ps",73,4,73,4],["Ps",73,7,73,7]]},{"text":"Popular applause. — Ac 12:22.","refs":[["Acts",12,22,12,22]]},{"text":"Gluttony. — Isa 22:13; Hab 1:16.","refs":[["Isa",22,13,22,13],["Hab",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"Drunkenness. — Isa 5:11; 56:12.","refs":[["Isa",5,11,5,11],["Isa",56,12,56,12]]},{"text":"Vain pleasure. — Job 21:12; Isa 5:12.","refs":[["Job",21,12,21,12],["Isa",5,12,5,12]]},{"text":"Successful oppression. — Hab 1:15; Jas 5:6.","refs":[["Hab",1,15,1,15],["Jas",5,6,5,6]]},{"text":"Marred by jealousy — Es 5:13.","refs":[["Esth",5,13,5,13]]},{"text":"Often interrupted by judgments — Nu 11:33; Job 15:21; Ps 73:18-20; Jer 25:10-11.","refs":[["Num",11,33,11,33],["Job",15,21,15,21],["Ps",73,18,73,20],["Jer",25,10,25,11]]},{"text":"Leads to sorrow — Pr 14:13.","refs":[["Prov",14,13,14,13]]},{"text":"Leads to recklessness — Isa 22:13.","refs":[["Isa",22,13,22,13]]},{"text":"Sometimes a stumbling-block to saints — Ps 73:3,16; Jer 12:1; Hab 1:13.","refs":[["Ps",73,3,73,3],["Ps",73,16,73,16],["Jer",12,1,12,1],["Hab",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Saints often permitted to see the end of — Ps 73:17-20.","refs":[["Ps",73,17,73,20]]},{"text":"Envy not — Ps 37:1.","refs":[["Ps",37,1,37,1]]},{"text":"Woe against — Am 6:1; Lu 6:25.","refs":[["Amos",6,1,6,1],["Luke",6,25,6,25]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Ps 37:35,36; Lu 12:16-20; 16:19-25.","refs":[["Ps",37,35,37,35],["Ps",37,36,37,36],["Luke",12,16,12,20],["Luke",16,19,16,25]]},{"text":"Israel. — Nu 11:33.","refs":[["Num",11,33,11,33]]},{"text":"Haman. — Es 5:9-11.","refs":[["Esth",5,9,5,11]]},{"text":"Belshazzar. — Da 5:1.","refs":[["Dan",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Herod. — Ac 12:21-23.","refs":[["Acts",12,21,12,23]]}],"refCount":48}
